      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto gap-space-xs">
        <span class="font-label-tech text-label-tech text-primary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Our Services</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Roadside Support You Can Rely On</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Rapid intervention and specialized transport machinery ready across every key UK arterial route.</p>
      </div>
