        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="relative w-full h-56 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
            <img
              alt="Slide-bed flatbed vehicle recovery"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="400"
              height="224"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCuxNlzFMpWz2XnicH7G0EfRpE4zD4O9bP8LdLdxZKqOztX8DxtY92_zAN5KbMuqBxcLrca0Q2I0ZLhTPonJ8bWKvp5ERBAGiRqLFhovsusBMZSRfhJaIYV1pZPmjlu26JfBJAt9lZJSPZ3d82LmqWD726t49JJyZ5tcWn3EgFAK6dx7Px3vvwmgi1Ir9420pAZl-3spXR2VPG1Si7bvqeGp_Q71RPJnc3do4jijjlUeXxQyvk-sW9O"
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-primary text-on-primary font-label-tech text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded">PRIORITY RECOVERY</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-space-lg flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-space-md">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Vehicle Recovery</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Full slide-bed recovery designed for complete non-runners, collision aftermath, EV machinery, and low-clearance performance vehicles safely anchored.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-space-sm flex items-center justify-between">
              <a class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary flex items-center gap-1" href="/services#vehicle-recovery">
                <span>Learn More</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
              <span class="font-label-tech text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Flatbed Tilt</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="relative w-full h-56 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
            <img
              alt="Roadside diagnostic assistance"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="400"
              height="224"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDBP7yBFw7i3eGxcgkvvZw9aYExzspeTFn-5CBjPFcG70Wx9oYHH9JUAKijRBLuEK0TfZLtNx4bm8KJwX204s258KrPiy-bQzyNJ6ZBCdjWTzlPYJjC6p7Xq3Q-nKcmJci4PK_8XnCCWt6DPZ-Oo_MAv6VW5jOoQQWY6iBzzmmnnuuYQtt02bhN0FX7pO08vmVmEmTlTjIy6nsZK3DI228lk5BYlH-3ozoZJMkRcIZszaqicabgnGVe"
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-tertiary text-on-tertiary font-label-tech text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded">RAPID RESOLUTION</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-space-lg flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-space-md">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Roadside Assistance</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                On-the-spot roadside diagnostics, high-amp 12V/24V battery jump-starts, safe spare wheel substitutions, emergency fuel drops, and key lockout support.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-space-sm flex items-center justify-between">
              <a class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary flex items-center gap-1" href="/services#roadside-assistance">
                <span>Learn More</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
              <span class="font-label-tech text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">On-Site Triage</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-surface-container-lowest rounded-xl shadow-md overflow-hidden flex flex-col transition-transform duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1">
          <div class="relative w-full h-56 bg-surface-container overflow-hidden">
            <img
              alt="Professional spec-lift towing service"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              width="400"
              height="224"
              loading="lazy"
              decoding="async"
              src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuCrrUWhPUbTqaaUkaG7xNVkSOw0BUkB24DkCuTJ3XtyHv0JNEUVjbRT3bcoIiRkkxZK75OofTJM09KtFpt1wRLyvxnz1YRwezOR3Q-AL8OQi9S2wtwpjTpFafiXXwLmbQ-eW9D1KMqlJt7nTtWJTw3SwMj0U_e3UBCLzkR6XR0EQEIxEa5XblYarlo9Rf_u_U2d-GydmwbccsyvTul1kbFVNP-2pfcigO8rw0sTr1kX21sGeXbzrUdb"
            />
            <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 bg-inverse-surface text-inverse-on-surface font-label-tech text-[11px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded">LONG DISTANCE</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-space-lg flex flex-col flex-grow justify-between gap-space-md">
            <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs">
              <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Towing Services</h3>
              <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                Dedicated spec-lift tow units offering reliable local and nationwide long-haul transit to certified garages, body repair workshops, or personal driveways.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="pt-space-sm flex items-center justify-between">
              <a class="font-label-lg text-label-lg text-primary hover:text-secondary flex items-center gap-1" href="/services#towing">
                <span>Learn More</span>
                <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">arrow_forward</span>
              </a>
              <span class="font-label-tech text-[11px] text-on-surface-variant">Spec-Lift Tow</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 4: EMERGENCY CTA BANNER -->
  <section class="w-full bg-primary text-on-primary py-space-xl">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile lg:px-margin">
      <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-space-lg">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-xs text-center lg:text-left max-w-2xl">
          <span class="font-label-tech text-label-tech uppercase tracking-widest text-primary-fixed">Immediate Dispatch Available</span>
          <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-primary">Stranded on the Road?</h2>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-body-lg text-on-primary/90">
            Get in touch with The Road Rescue Guys for professional roadside assistance, recovery or towing. Speak directly with a local dispatcher.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-space-sm flex-shrink-0 w-full sm:w-auto">
          <a class="w-full sm:w-auto h-14 px-8 bg-surface-container-lowest text-primary hover:bg-surface-container-low font-label-lg text-label-lg rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-space-xs shadow-md transition-colors" href="tel:07700900123">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">phone_in_talk</span>
            <span>Call 07700 900123</span>
          </a>
          <a class="w-full sm:w-auto h-14 px-8 bg-secondary hover:bg-on-secondary-container text-on-primary font-label-lg text-label-lg rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center gap-space-xs transition-colors" href="https://wa.me/447700900123" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]">chat</span>
            <span>WhatsApp Us</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SECTION 5: WHY CHOOSE US -->
  <section class="w-full bg-surface-container-lowest py-space-xl lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-margin-mobile lg:px-margin flex flex-col gap-space-xl">
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto gap-space-xs">
        <span class="font-label-tech text-label-tech text-primary uppercase tracking-widest font-bold">Why Choose Us</span>
        <h2 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg text-on-surface">Roadside Help Without the Hassle</h2>
        <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">Engineering precision and transparent logistics designed to remove stress from roadside emergencies.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-space-xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">alarm_on</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">24/7 Availability</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Our dispatch hubs and roadside units operate round the clock, every bank holiday, day or night across the UK network.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">bolt</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Fast Response</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Direct dispatch routing from strategically positioned depots guarantees typical response windows within 25–40 minutes.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">verified_user</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Professional Service</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            All drivers are fully certified under PAS 43 standards, equipped with modern equipment and safety gear.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">forum</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Clear Communication</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            Direct contact with your allocated recovery technician with live WhatsApp location sharing and realistic arrival times.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-primary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-primary">
            <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[26px]">health_and_safety</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">Reliable Recovery</h3>
          <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
            High-capacity slide beds capable of managing prestige vehicles, light commercials, non-rolling machinery, and AWD crossovers.
          </p>
